WEBVTT

00:03:59.103 --> 00:04:00.134
Audience: 162.

00:04:00.158 --> 00:04:03.977
162 squared is 26,244.

00:04:04.001 --> 00:04:05.087
Volunteer: Yes.

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:06.120
Thank you very much.

00:04:06.144 --> 00:04:07.867
(Applause)

00:04:11.603 --> 00:04:12.976
(Applause ends)

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.976
Let me try to take this one step further.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.388
(Laughter)

00:04:17.412 --> 00:04:20.976
I'm going to try to square
a four-digit number this time.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.737
You can all take your time on this;

00:04:22.761 --> 00:04:24.955
I will not beat you
to the answer on this one,

00:04:24.979 --> 00:04:26.881
but I will try to get the answer right.

00:04:26.905 --> 00:04:30.444
To make this a little bit more random,
let's take the fourth row this time,